  - `vhk gen-service-compose-pack <project_dir>` (generate `docs/VHK_SERVICE_COMPOSE.md`, `docs/VHK_SERVICE_COMPOSE_PLAN.json`, `scripts/vhk_refresh_service_compose_pack.sh`, and a session-service handoff under `build/publish/<bundle-name>/service/` that now includes bundle-state runner helpers)
